<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b9d7bc76f58a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's the first Apple device to include Face ID, a face-mapping technology that can be used unlock the phone, verify Apple Pay, and essentially replaces the fingerprint scanner (or Touch ID)." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "444" .

